Welcome our new born deity! For your time climbing the Pillar of Divinity,
you have earned the right to guide future generations through the Pillar. 

If your hero manages to climb to surmount the challenge, you will be given access to a single wish. 
So cheer hard, manage your blessings, and choose wisely.

The pillar is kind to no one, including you. If you hero periches, they will not return.

